{
 "name": "Char_ZanNi_FireHair_OneSidedHETAShadowLord",
 "entry": "WuwaToonZaniFireHairBasePass_OneSidedHETAShadowLord",
 "include": "/Plugin/WuwaToon/Private/WuwaToonBasePass_ZaniFire.ush",
 "kuro_shading_model": "MSM_ToonHair (GBufferB id 15, 12 on tail vertices)",
 "kuro_asm": "M_Char_ZanNi_FireHair PS faa84b7e77 (#94449) / VS 0d6678f2ab (#56022); UseFireHair, one-sided normal, IsHairHET, UseShadowLordMaterial",
 "kuro_root_material": "M_Char_ZanNi_FireHair",
 "blend_mode": "BLEND_Masked",
 "two_sided": true,
 "resolve": true,
 "resolve_note": "toon GBuffer through WuwaToonResolve. M_Char_ZanNi_FireHair packing: A = (oct(N), 0.95, skin >= 0.5 ? 0.666 : 0 | mode 1: 1), B = (sqrt(saturate(FireRimColor)), id 15, or 12 on tail vertices VertexColor.y <= 0), C = (lit fire colour, MainTex.a * OpacityIntensity | mode 1: rim byte), D = (ToonRimWidth, 0, 0, 0 | mode 1: 0). Masked: route OpacityMask to the material Opacity Mask (clip 0.3333, Kuro folds it into mad(mask, heta, -0.3333)); the Kuro primitive dither is clipped inside. IsHairHET: C.a = VertexColor.a (mode 0) / odd byte of VertexColor.a (mode 1). UseShadowLordMaterial: C.rgb += UseShadowLordMaterialDynamic * ShadowLord colour.",
 "vs_note": "VS 0d6678f2ab (#56022): the fire-hair World Position Offset (FlowTex noise, per-group sine / expand, tangent sine) is ported as the \"wpo\" entry and verified bit-exact on SV_POSITION with the stream-output VS harness (tools/shaderdiff/weapons/r3/zani_vs_wpo_toon.py); its E_Hologram / E_Motion WPO block is gated off at every roster MI (USE Hologram = 0, E_Motion_Offset.w = 0) and not ported. TEXCOORD2 (light direction + motion mask) is symbolically identical to the verified Body VS #35700 (r3/zani_vs_status.py).",
 "outputs": {
  "Emissive": {
   "type": "float3",
   "kuro": "o0.rgb SceneColor (o0.a = 0)"
  },
  "A": {
   "type": "float4",
   "kuro": "o1 GBufferA: xy oct normal, z toon shadow factor, w flag"
  },
  "B": {
   "type": "float4",
   "kuro": "o2 GBufferB: rgb sqrt(shadow colour), a (LightingChannelMask<<5 | ShadingModelId)/255"
  },
  "C": {
   "type": "float4",
   "kuro": "o3 GBufferC: rgb lit colour, a MainTex.a*OpacityIntensity / rim byte"
  },
  "D": {
   "type": "float4",
   "kuro": "o6 \"GBufferD\": x ToonRimWidth, y packed nibble, z 0, w packed AO|FFT"
  },
  "OpacityMask": {
   "type": "float",
   "kuro": "masked clip input, clip value 0.3333"
  }
 },
